"""v4 bot for Bay Area (3 hole cards; at the flop discard 1, expose 1).

Every betting decision = score a few legal candidate actions with ONE simple value function
(chips, see q_* below), then pick by a tight softmax over near-ties (K["temp"]).
All tunable dials are in K; TUNING.md maps each dial to the field statistic that moves it.

Layers (single file: tables are embedded, so agent.py alone is a complete upload):
  PLATFORM  act(): memory envelope, per-seat stats from events, legality funnel, try/except.
  STRATEGY  candidates + value function + softmax; preflop unopened by percentile tables.
  ENGINE    embedded 3-card tables (tools/build_tables.py), eval7 evaluation / Monte Carlo.
Kit conventions (verified in sdk/engine): Seat.stack excludes the street bet, state.pot
includes it, own actions are echoed in events, kinds are lowercase strings.
"""

import os

for _v in ("OMP_NUM_THREADS", "MKL_NUM_THREADS", "OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS",
           "VECLIB_MAXIMUM_THREADS", "NUMBA_NUM_THREADS"):
    os.environ.setdefault(_v, "1")

import gc
